WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:02.500
KATE BISHOP
Can I tell you a secret?

00:00:03.543 --> 00:00:05.410
I'm working with an Avenger!

00:00:10.271 --> 00:00:11.601
CLINT BARTON
Can I speak to your manager?

00:00:15.728 --> 00:00:16.630
KATE BISHOP
Didn't realize we were supposed

00:00:16.681 --> 00:00:17.681
to bring guns.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:21.294
CLINT BARTON
It's almost Christmas.

00:00:23.739 --> 00:00:24.739
I can't go home...

00:00:25.435 --> 00:00:26.505
until I fix this.

00:00:28.847 --> 00:00:29.997
LILA BARTON
Should we be worried?

00:00:30.048 --> 00:00:31.048
CLINT BARTON
I'll be home for Christmas,

00:00:31.404 --> 00:00:32.753
I promise.
[Groans]

00:00:41.403 --> 00:00:42.403
CLINT BARTON
Sorry, Santa.

00:00:43.533 --> 00:00:44.732
We're out of regular arrows.

00:00:45.361 --> 00:00:46.820
KATE BISHOP
Oh my God, trick arrows?

00:00:49.393 --> 00:00:50.570
KATE BISHOP
We're saving the holidays.

00:00:53.531 --> 00:00:54.531
[Screaming]

